        "meaning_cn": "依语境表示过去一般能力/许可、现在或未来可能性、委婉请求或建议",
        "definition_en": "choose among past general ability/permission, present or future possibility, and polite request/suggestion by context",
        "boundary": "affirmative one-off past achievement normally prefers was/were able to or managed to, not plain could",
        "level": "L1",
        "pos": "modal",
        "source": "final-standard-bf11"
      },
      {
        "construction_id": "construction:could:bf11-have-pp",
