        "meaning_cn": "表示过去可能发生、未实现的选择/能力，或对过去行为的批评（本可以……）",
        "definition_en": "express past possibility, an unrealized option or ability, or criticism of what someone could have done",
        "boundary": "past possibility/unrealized alternative/criticism; distinguish from simple past general ability",
        "level": "L1",
        "pos": "modal",
        "source": "final-standard-bf11"
      }
