      "core_meaning_cn": "情态动词：过去一般能力/许可、现在或未来可能性、委婉请求/建议；could have + 过去分词还表达过去可能性、未实现选择或批评",
      "core_meaning_en": "modal for past general ability/permission, present or future possibility, polite requests or suggestions, and could have + past participle for past possibility or unrealized alternatives",
      "mental_model_cn": "past general ability/permission → could；present/future possibility → could；polite request/suggestion → Could you…?/You could…；肯定句一次性过去成功通常用 was/were able to 或 managed to；could have + pp → 过去可能、未实现选择或带批评的本可做到。",
